{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pre-Fortress 2 </strong>is a mod for Team Fortress 2  that brings back elements of previous Team Fortress installments in a fast-paced environment that is perfect for casual or competitive play. Capture flags, take names, and blast jump through a world heavily inspired by the art from Team Fortress 2's  development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/6a332433d8bcfe3b63c2429836a7f128.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=716 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REVIVED GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Grenades</strong> are back! Revised in both gameplay and visuals, grenades are a classic Team Fortress staple, acting as both a great way to clear a crowded room of people or as an alternate means of transportation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor</strong> makes a return to the series and gives players the extra edge over their competition. Play strategically and remember to repair your  armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team Fortress Classic weapons return: <strong>Nailgun</strong>, <strong>Tranquilizer</strong>, <strong>Detonation Pipe Launcher</strong>, <strong>Flame Rocket</strong> and <strong>Classic Sniper Rifle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Syringe</strong> to Heal your teammates  or infect your enemies with the <i><strong>Rot</strong></i> as Medic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flag Throwing</strong> is back! Pass it to your friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/612fcddc2e498621f10ddeda7fd7a22a.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=631 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCLUSIVE GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair your teammates' armor using the <strong>Wrench</strong> as Engineer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through any teams <strong>Teleporter</strong> and restock on any teams <strong>Dispenser</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolishing</strong> your <strong>Dispenser</strong> and <strong>Teleporter</strong> as Engineer acts as a surprise explosive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Propel yourself to new heights using the <strong>Flame Rocket</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No random critical hits!</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/c2e429e121b89c4447da173d72c01e50.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=707 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRENADES!!!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast</strong> away opponents with the <strong>Frag Grenade</strong> as most classes!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scouts can now slow and outrun danger using <strong>Bear Traps</strong> and <strong>Concussion Grenades</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scatter the enemy as Soldier using  <strong>Nail Grenades</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt down your foes as Pyro using the power of the <strong>Napalm Grenade</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demoman and Heavy can lay down a suppressing hail of explosives with the <strong>MIRV</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporarily disable a Sentry nest as Engineer with the <strong>EMP Grenade</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your team quickly back into battle with Medic's <strong>Healing Grenade</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a quick getaway as Spy and leave the enemy dazed with the <strong>Gas Grenade</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/0e9ca1f7e601e487b0168012a819d4cb.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REDISCOVERING TEAM FORTRESS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit Team Fortress Classic maps such as <strong>Canalzone,\u00a0Crossover</strong>, <strong>Push</strong>\u00a0and much more as they make their return to the map rotation. Hit the server browser and grenade jump your way through this classic selection!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>VOX Announcer</strong> is back from Team Fortress Classic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative map layouts from the development period of Team Fortress 2.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555120?t=1765598885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555120?t=1765598885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/a91f57cc3d06ddb3733b9421f0b6888fbf1e0c25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765598885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/a91f57cc3d06ddb3733b9421f0b6888fbf1e0c25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765598885","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes Source SDK","id":16}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains Cartoon violence "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pre-Fortress 2 </strong>is a mod for Team Fortress 2  that brings back elements of previous Team Fortress installments in a fast-paced environment that is perfect for casual or competitive play. Capture flags, take names, and blast jump through a world heavily inspired by the art from Team Fortress 2's  development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/6a332433d8bcfe3b63c2429836a7f128.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=716 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REVIVED GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Grenades</strong> are back! Revised in both gameplay and visuals, grenades are a classic Team Fortress staple, acting as both a great way to clear a crowded room of people or as an alternate means of transportation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor</strong> makes a return to the series and gives players the extra edge over their competition. Play strategically and remember to repair your  armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team Fortress Classic weapons return: <strong>Nailgun</strong>, <strong>Tranquilizer</strong>, <strong>Detonation Pipe Launcher</strong>, <strong>Flame Rocket</strong> and <strong>Classic Sniper Rifle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Syringe</strong> to Heal your teammates  or infect your enemies with the <i><strong>Rot</strong></i> as Medic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flag Throwing</strong> is back! Pass it to your friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/612fcddc2e498621f10ddeda7fd7a22a.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=631 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCLUSIVE GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair your teammates' armor using the <strong>Wrench</strong> as Engineer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through any teams <strong>Teleporter</strong> and restock on any teams <strong>Dispenser</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolishing</strong> your <strong>Dispenser</strong> and <strong>Teleporter</strong> as Engineer acts as a surprise explosive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Propel yourself to new heights using the <strong>Flame Rocket</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No random critical hits!</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/c2e429e121b89c4447da173d72c01e50.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=707 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRENADES!!!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast</strong> away opponents with the <strong>Frag Grenade</strong> as most classes!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scouts can now slow and outrun danger using <strong>Bear Traps</strong> and <strong>Concussion Grenades</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scatter the enemy as Soldier using  <strong>Nail Grenades</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt down your foes as Pyro using the power of the <strong>Napalm Grenade</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demoman and Heavy can lay down a suppressing hail of explosives with the <strong>MIRV</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporarily disable a Sentry nest as Engineer with the <strong>EMP Grenade</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your team quickly back into battle with Medic's <strong>Healing Grenade</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a quick getaway as Spy and leave the enemy dazed with the <strong>Gas Grenade</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/extras/0e9ca1f7e601e487b0168012a819d4cb.avif?t=1765598885\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REDISCOVERING TEAM FORTRESS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit Team Fortress Classic maps such as <strong>Canalzone,\u00a0Crossover</strong>, <strong>Push</strong>\u00a0and much more as they make their return to the map rotation. Hit the server browser and grenade jump your way through this classic selection!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>VOX Announcer</strong> is back from Team Fortress Classic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative map layouts from the development period of Team Fortress 2.</p></li></ul>","developers":["PF2 Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555120/177581450793fb1626e02311462df0ea94a23185/header.jpg?t=1765598885","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Valve, the Valve logo, Steam, the Steam logo, Team Fortress, and the Team Fortress logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Valve Corporation. Pre-Fortress 2 is a fan creation and is not affiliated with Valve Corporation.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04.6 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130T<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 860M equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970 or hig